@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra may chu dang chay (Health check) -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach bai tap (List assignments) -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Chi tiet bai tap ton tai (Existing assignment) -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 4. Bai tap khong ton tai (Missing assignment) -> 404 Not Found + ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 5. Nop bai hop le vao bai tap mo -> 201 Created + Header Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200402",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200402-bit/V-Duy-Linh-dtc245200402"
}

### 6. Doc lai luot nop vua tao qua Location -> 200 OK
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 7. Nop bai thieu thong tin (du lieu rong) -> 400 Bad Request + INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 8. Nop vao bai tap da dong -> 400 Bad Request + ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/2/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200402",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200402-bit/V-Duy-Linh-dtc245200402"
}

### 9. Luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 Not Found + SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 10. Thieu header Content-Type -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200402",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/dtc245200402-bit/V-Duy-Linh-dtc245200402"
}

### 11. Sai phuong thuc HTTP -> 405 Method Not Allowed
PUT {{api}}/api/assignments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}
